const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先进入选择集合，再谈偏好",en:"Attention shapes the choice set before preferences act"},body:{zh:"Barber与Odean把选择分成先注意到哪些股票、再在其中选择两个环节。研究的机制是有限注意力改变候选集合，而不是所有人看到同一消息都会买同一只股票。关注度解释为什么进入视野，偏好仍决定后续选择。",en:"The paper separates noticing stocks from choosing among them. Limited attention changes the consideration set; it does not imply that everyone buys the same stock after seeing news. Attention helps explain entry into consideration, while preferences still determine choices."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · pp. 785–786",en:"2008 journal article · pp. 785–786"}}},{title:{zh:"买入与卖出的搜索空间不对称",en:"Buying and selling involve different search spaces"},body:{zh:"个人投资者买入时可以面对大量股票，卖出时往往只考虑已有的少量持仓，且很少卖空。作者用这种不对称解释注意力为何更影响买入。这个前提与样本交易习惯有关，不能无条件套到持仓广泛或经常卖空的参与者。",en:"Individuals can choose among many stocks when buying but usually sell from a small existing portfolio and rarely short. This asymmetry motivates a stronger attention effect on buying. It need not apply unchanged to participants with broad holdings or frequent short selling."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · p. 786",en:"2008 journal article · p. 786"}}},{title:{zh:"三种代理都不是直接读出注意力",en:"None of the three proxies directly observes attention"},body:{zh:"研究通过新闻、异常成交量和极端收益间接观察可能引起关注的事件。新闻记录不告诉作者到底多少人阅读，成交放大也可能来自少数大额交易。多个代理帮助从不同角度检验解释，但不能把代理值本身写成人群注意力的精确计量。",en:"News, unusual volume and extreme returns indirectly indicate attention-grabbing events. News archives do not count readers, and large trades can raise volume without widespread attention. Multiple proxies provide complementary evidence, not exact measurements of the population's attention."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · p. 787",en:"2008 journal article · p. 787"}}},{title:{zh:"要检验的是净买入，不只是交易增多",en:"The hypothesis concerns net buying, not merely more trading"},body:{zh:"若把成交量本身作为注意力代理，再发现成交活跃，几乎只是重复定义。作者真正比较的是特定投资者群体在高关注日更倾向买入还是卖出。买卖方向、投资者分类和交易数量必须分开，只有总成交量无法回答这个问题。",en:"Using volume as an attention proxy and then finding active trading would be close to circular. The hypothesis instead concerns whether a specified investor group buys more than it sells. Direction, group classification and trading intensity must be distinguished."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · p. 788",en:"2008 journal article · p. 788"}}},{title:{zh:"机构的选择条件可能不同",en:"Institutions can face different choice conditions"},body:{zh:"机构可能持有更多股票、具有不同卖空条件，也投入更多资源筛选对象，因此不能假设个人与机构面对完全相同的注意力约束。研究按不同投资者样本比较，而不是把全部交易压成一个平均账户；这种分类也不代表每家机构行为相同。",en:"Institutions can hold more stocks, face different short-selling conditions and devote more resources to selection. The study compares investor samples rather than one average account. These categories do not imply identical behavior within every institution or individual group."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · pp. 787–788",en:"2008 journal article · pp. 787–788"}}},{title:{zh:"价格变化也可能由买入引起",en:"Buying can cause price changes as well as follow them"},body:{zh:"作者使用前一日收益作为一个注意力代理，以减轻同日买入本身造成价格变化的内生性。这个处理体现研究设计的重要性，但不能消除所有共同原因。关注被激活与未来回报可靠，是不同命题；本研究不提供追逐热点的依据。",en:"Prior-day returns help reduce the endogeneity of same-day buying causing price moves. That timing choice does not remove every common cause. Evidence that attention is activated differs from reliable future-return evidence; it is not a basis for chasing prominent stocks."},reference:{url:"https://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/Papers%20current%20versions/AllThatGlitters_RFS_2008.pdf",label:{zh:"2008年期刊版 · p. 788 · footnote 4",en:"2008 journal article · p. 788 · footnote 4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"关注度不是看多情绪，也不是收益预测。文中的注意力代理和投资者交易样本各有边界；总体买卖必然对应，不能把某组净买入说成全市场净买入。",en:"Attention is not bullish sentiment or a return forecast. Attention proxies and investor samples are bounded; one group's net buying is not net buying by the entire market."}};export{e as default};
